# torchfits: backport of upstream CFITSIO develop commits (getcols.c)
#   de7da7908bca0b9ed70d219a35e8627667ced779 (2026-09-09)
#     "Additional bounds checking for var string cols in cfitsio and
#      fitsverify." (only getcols.c: utilities/fvrf_data.c is fitsverify,
#      which torchfits does not build)
#   93dba91ea0356c3840825d8866db41499fcca536 (2026-09-14, PR #184)
#     "fix: check variable-length string buffer bounds before read"
#   113781d8aa442cf8d3c27295d9084674b8b039f2 (2026-10-21)
